sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor U as User
    participant C as ReplayController
    participant S as ReplayStore
    participant P as ReplayPlayer
    participant Cmd as ReplayCommand
    participant St as ReplayState

    Note over U,S: Load a replay
    U->>C: click "Browse Replays..."
    C->>S: list()
    S-->>C: List~ReplayFileMeta~
    C-->>U: render file picker

    U->>C: select file
    C->>S: load(path)
    S-->>C: ReplayFile
    C->>P: new ReplayPlayer(file.commands, new ReplayState())

    Note over U,St: Step forward (apply)
    U->>C: click "Step Forward"
    C->>P: stepForward()
    P->>Cmd: apply(state)
    Cmd->>St: append moveLog entry; add payoffs to scores
    P->>P: nextIndex++
    P-->>C: void
    C->>St: read currentRound, scores, moveLog
    C-->>U: re-render scrub bar + panels

    Note over U,St: Step back (undo)
    U->>C: click "Step Back"
    C->>P: stepBack()
    P->>P: nextIndex--
    P->>Cmd: undo(state)
    Cmd->>St: pop moveLog entry; subtract payoffs
    P-->>C: void
    C->>St: read state
    C-->>U: re-render

    Note over U,St: Seek (scrub bar drag)
    U->>C: drag scrub to target index
    C->>P: seekTo(targetIndex)
    loop while nextIndex != targetIndex
        alt nextIndex < targetIndex
            P->>Cmd: apply(state)
        else nextIndex > targetIndex
            P->>Cmd: undo(state)
        end
    end
    P-->>C: void
    C-->>U: re-render at target position
